From b04845a92c02561edc04357799bbea90976cada5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:40:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Give stem-less heads a small boost again (whole notes of
 other fonts)

Heads are matched against Bravura's templates. A whole note of another
engraving font matches at a grade of only 0.45-0.6, and a stem-less head
below the minimum contextual grade (0.5) is dropped at once: it can never
get support from a stem. A whole note on a ledger line, next to an
accidental, or the upper note of an octave lost a few hundredths and
vanished; the half-note head found at its place (grade ~0.2) then had no
stem and was removed too, so the note was missing from the export.

stemLessBoost (0.38 upstream once, then 0) is now 0.15: grades from about
0.45 up are kept.
---
 .../java/org/audiveris/omr/sheet/note/NoteHeadsBuilder.java     | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/audiveris/omr/sheet/note/NoteHeadsBuilder.java b/app/src/main/java/org/audiveris/omr/sheet/note/NoteHeadsBuilder.java
index 0f908275..77124df8 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/audiveris/omr/sheet/note/NoteHeadsBuilder.java
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/audiveris/omr/sheet/note/NoteHeadsBuilder.java
@@ -1258,7 +1258,7 @@ public class NoteHeadsBuilder
                 "Vertical margin for intercepting stem seed around a target pitch");
 
         private final Constant.Ratio stemLessBoost = new Constant.Ratio(
-                0, // Was 0.38,
+                0.15, // Was 0.38, then 0
                 "How much do we boost stem-less heads (always isolated)");
 
         private final Constant.Ratio crossBoost = new Constant.Ratio(
